#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This legacy example uses a vehicle with a brake system with pedal-force input, power boost, a volume-flow parameter for caliper dynamics, and thermal/fade effects. ABS conrol is provided by a Simulink model with a model that used to be called "Type A" (ABS control is applied before proportioning).
#
#This version of the example uses the same linked dataset for the brake system as past versions. This dataset is from a legacy library, rather than the more versatile 4W brake system library.
#
#Datasets from the legacy library (Brakes: Four-Wheel System w. Boost and Thermal Effects) still work as intended.
#
#However, dataset for Import variables was modified for version 2017 to provide compatiblity with newer conventions involving VS Import options.  (See the Import dataset for notes about the changes.)
#
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

